{"id":67605,"date":"2025-08-16T15:50:59","date_gmt":"2025-08-16T14:50:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67605"},"modified":"2026-09-27T22:28:47","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T21:28:47","slug":"treino-trail-convivio-trilho-dos-cagados","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/treino-trail-convivio-trilho-dos-cagados\/","title":{"rendered":"5\u00ba Treino Trail Conv\u00edvio Trilho dos C\u00e1gados VCO 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">5\u00ba Treino Trail Conv\u00edvio Trilho dos C\u00e1gados VCO 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>5\u00ba Treino Trail Conv\u00edvio Trilho dos C\u00e1gados VCO 2026<\/strong> realiza-se na ter\u00e7a-feira, <strong>1 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (feriado nacional), na acolhedora localidade de <strong>Vila Ch\u00e3 de Ourique<\/strong>, concelho do <strong>Cartaxo<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Trilho dos C\u00e1gados VCO<\/strong>, o evento \u00e9 uma aut\u00eantica celebra\u00e7\u00e3o do trail running e do pedestrianismo no Ribatejo, aliando o desafio desportivo num tra\u00e7ado de natureza ao esp\u00edrito de conv\u00edvio e camaradagem entre atletas e caminheiros.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada junto ao Pavilh\u00e3o de Festas de Vila Ch\u00e3 de Ourique, os participantes t\u00eam \u00e0 escolha quatro dist\u00e2ncias adaptadas a todos os n\u00edveis: o exigente Trail Longo de 26 km (+1.150 m D+), o competitivo Trail Curto de 18 km (+850 m D+), o acess\u00edvel Mini Trail de 12 km (+350 m D+) e a tradicional Caminhada de 12 km (+205 m D+). O percurso desbrava os trilhos florestais, linhas de \u00e1gua e cumeadas rurais da regi\u00e3o, culminando no j\u00e1 afamado almo\u00e7o de conv\u00edvio com anima\u00e7\u00e3o e refor\u00e7os gastron\u00f3micos para todos os atletas inscritos.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span