 5\u00ba Treino Trail Conv\u00edvio Trilho dos C\u00e1gados VCO 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no dia 1 de dezembro de 2026 (ter\u00e7a-feira, feriado nacional), com partidas a partir das 08:30 em Vila Ch\u00e3 de Ourique, concelho do Cartaxo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde \u00e9 o local de partida e concentra\u00e7\u00e3o do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e partida t\u00eam lugar junto ao Pavilh\u00e3o de Festas de Vila Ch\u00e3 de Ourique, concelho do Cartaxo, distrito de Santar\u00e9m.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis 4 dist\u00e2ncias: Trail Longo de 26 km (+1.150 m D+), Trail Curto de 18 km (+850 m D+), Mini Trail de 12 km (+350 m D+) e Caminhada de 12 km (+205 m D+).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui almo\u00e7o e abastecimentos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui almo\u00e7o de conv\u00edvio e abastecimentos ao longo do percurso (3 abastecimentos no Trail Longo, 2 no Trail Curto e 1 no Mini Trail e Caminhada).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma Acorrer (acorrer.pt), com pre\u00e7os a partir de 8,00 \u20ac nas primeiras fases.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"5\u00ba Treino Trail Conv\u00edvio Trilho dos C\u00e1gados VCO 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-01\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Cartaxo, Santar\u00e9m\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Cartaxo\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza o 5\u00ba Treino Trail Conv\u00edvio Trilho dos C\u00e1gados VCO 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no dia 1 de dezembro de 2026 (ter\u00e7a-feira, feriado nacional), com partidas a partir das 08:30 em Vila Ch\u00e3 de Ourique, concelho do Cartaxo.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde \u00e9 o local de partida e concentra\u00e7\u00e3o do evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e partida t\u00eam lugar junto ao Pavilh\u00e3o de Festas de Vila Ch\u00e3 de Ourique, concelho do Cartaxo, distrito de Santar\u00e9m.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis 4 dist\u00e2ncias: Trail Longo de 26 km (+1.150 m D+), Trail Curto de 18 km (+850 m D+), Mini Trail de 12 km (+350 m D+) e Caminhada de 12 km (+205 m D+).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui almo\u00e7o e abastecimentos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui almo\u00e7o de conv\u00edvio e abastecimentos ao longo do percurso (3 abastecimentos no Trail Longo, 2 no Trail Curto e 1 no Mini Trail e Caminhada).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma Acorrer (acorrer.pt), com pre\u00e7os a partir de 8,00 \u20ac nas primeiras fases.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67790,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[727,820,39],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-67605","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-cartaxo-santarem","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail